&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-unorderedListItem public-DraftStyleDefault-depth0 public-DraftStyleDefault-listLTR&quot; data-block=&quot;true&quot; data-editor=&quot;2sd18&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;chppn-0-0&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;chppn-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;chppn-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Helped lead a team&#39;s shift to AI-native workflows, and can speak to what changed about the work itself, not just the tools.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-unorderedListItem public-DraftStyleDefault-depth0 public-DraftStyleDefault-listLTR&quot; data-block=&quot;true&quot; data-editor=&quot;2sd18&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;263rh-0-0&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;263rh-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;263rh-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Background contributing to AI governance, evaluation practices, or AI experience design patterns.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-unorderedListItem public-DraftStyleDefault-depth0 public-DraftStyleDefault-listLTR&quot; data-block=&quot;true&quot; data-editor=&quot;2sd18&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;ffc55-0-0&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;ffc55-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;ffc55-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Experience designing for internal or expert users (advisors, agents, support staff) alongside customer-facing surfaces.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
