&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll be part of the team building the next generation of the business insurance purchase experience at Gusto. This role is built for someone who wants to be part of a fast-growing team and build products that customers like to use. You&#39;ll take projects from design through implementation to launch, working closely with a good size team to ship AI-powered features that simplify and modernize how businesses discover, evaluate, and purchase insurance. If you&#39;re excited about joining a team early in its growth, executing reliably on shipping products rapidly, and learning by building alongside experienced engineers, you&#39;ll thrive here.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Team:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Business Insurance is one of Gusto&#39;s fastest-growing areas. We own the end-to-end business insurance experience — both on and off the Gusto platform — spanning the sale and servicing of P&amp;amp;C insurance products such as Workers&#39; Compensation and General Liability, as well as PEO. The domain is inherently complex, and that complexity creates real opportunity: to rethink how small business owners experience insurance through innovative AI and thoughtful system design, moving the industry beyond its traditional constraints and delivering something meaningfully better for our customers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Here’s what you’ll do day-to-day:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design, build, and test core Business Insurance products that are reliable and scalable&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and implement innovative AI-powered Business Insurance experiences&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Iterate quickly based on feedback and metrics once features are live.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with product, design and XF partners to refine ideas, shape scope, and iterate quickly on end-to-end experiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mentor and develop engineers on your team. Track record of elevating team capabilities through pairing, code review, and knowledge sharing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Here’s what we&#39;re looking for:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8+ years of software development experience, 2+ years of doing customer facing products at scale.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;AI-native mindset with AI tools naturally embedded in your daily workflow.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Impact-driven with proven end-to-end multi-quarter projects delivery experience, from initial scoping and planning through execution, stakeholder management, and successful launch.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Genuine excitement about joining a fast-growing and high velocity team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Natural aptitude for bringing clarity and simplicity to complex, ambiguous problems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong documentation and communication skills, with the ability to clearly articulate technical tradeoffs and align solutions with business needs across both technical and non-technical audiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong Platform and Application Engineering experience (e.g., services, APIs, data flows, observability)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong hands-on experience building, deploying and evaluating AI solutions in production environments is a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Ruby on Rails and Python is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
